## Why This Is Asked

Tests end-to-end real-time pipeline design, AI inference integration, privacy controls, and cost trade-offs in production-scale systems.

## Key Concepts

- Event-driven architecture and streaming integration (WebSocket, Kinesis, Lambda)
- SageMaker endpoint invocation and model monitoring
- PII redaction strategies and compliance (encryption, access controls, retention)
- Data lake indexing (S3, DynamoDB) and cost implications

## Code Example

```javascript
import { SageMakerRuntimeClient, InvokeEndpointCommand } from "@aws-sdk/client-sagemaker-runtime";

const client = new SageMakerRuntimeClient({ region: 'us-east-1' });

async function analyze(message){
  const cmd = new InvokeEndpointCommand({
    EndpointName: 'chat-sentiment-intent',
    ContentType: 'text/plain',
    Body: message
  });
  const res = await client.send(cmd);
  return JSON.parse(res.Body.toString());
}
```

